# Firmware stand-ins for the dreamsourcelab-dslogic model
# (emu/src/models/dreamsourcelab-dslogic.rs): the FX2 firmware and the
# FPGA bitstreams the driver uploads to the five emulated profiles. The
# sizes are the model's PROFILES, which a unit test checks; they are not
# those of DreamSourceLab's files, which the model does not need (it
# checks the stand-ins byte for byte). The bitstreams stay below the
# driver's FW_BUFSIZE (1 MiB), so each goes in one bulk transfer, as the
# real ones do.
dreamsourcelab-dslogic-plus-fx2.fw 8404
dreamsourcelab-dslogic-basic-fx2.fw 8412
dreamsourcelab-dslogic-pro-fx2.fw 8396
dreamsourcelab-dslogic-fx2.fw 8388
dreamsourcelab-dscope-fx2.fw 8420
dreamsourcelab-dslogic-plus-fpga.fw 341212
dreamsourcelab-dslogic-basic-fpga.fw 341220
dreamsourcelab-dslogic-pro-fpga.fw 583340
dreamsourcelab-dslogic-fpga-3v3.fw 340604
dreamsourcelab-dslogic-fpga-5v.fw 340612
dreamsourcelab-dscope-fpga.fw 583348
